			"notes": "## ADDED:\n- Added 24 new events\n  - You heard that right, 24.\n  - It would have been 23 but I refused to have 67 events in my mod.\n- Added 2 endings\n- Added new dimensions\n- Added downloadable safe version (less to none PC interactions)\n- Added full multiplayer support (use Essential)\n- Added a couple conditioned events\n- Added memories\n- Added 95% completed Mac OS support\n- Added a search filter to the config menu\n- Updated Shriek support to remove logging issues\n- Probably a lot more stuff that I forgot to write down\n\n## CHANGED:\n- Changed sleep detection for sleep events to better work with other mods\n- Changed the MINE event to have a surface entrance\n- Reworked world data tracking and game configuration\n  - There is a known issue where if you play with an old config in this version, the mod will not play events naturally. You can check if this is happening to you by looking in the in game config and seeing if event weights is empty. If it is, delete your config and restart.\n\n## FIXED:\n- Fixed .txt files generating on the desktop in Linux\n- Fixed a crash when an event played while the player was dead\n- Fixed an item duplication glitch with the LIFT and SURROUND events\n- Again I forgot to write stuff down\n\n## REMOVED:\nTo comply with Modrinth, the BROWSER event, as well as a WebSocket used to troll people with, has been removed."
