			"notes": "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> There is **no** 'safe' version included with this release, although no damage is ever truly done anyway. 'Safe' versions will be accessible once the full release is out.\n\n## ADDED:\n- Added more translations! (French, Russian, Turkish, German (Deutschland), Swedish, Italian, Dutch, Czech, Hungarian, Romanian and Chinese Simplified)\n- Added visual indicator for what languages are supported by Split Self\n- Added The Forgotten Entity\n  - They will only spawn if a house also spawns in the same session\n  - Getting close to them will allow for communication\n- Added `meadow` to limbo dimension\n- Added `FORGOTTEN` event\n- Added `SURROUND` event\n- Added `LIFT` event\n- Added `ESCAPE` event\n- Added `LOGS` event\n- Added `DISCONNECT` event\n- Added `WHISPER` event\n- Added `EJECT` event\n- Added `FREEZE` event\n- Added `BLU` event\n- Added Freedom Music Disc\n- Added `repeatEventsAfter` config value; events will NOT repeat until a certain amount of events later\n- [Added Shriek as an optional dependency, requires Architectury API](https://modrinth.com/mod/shriek)\n  - If this mod isn't installed, a button will appear in the top left of the title screen, prompting you to download\n- Added Tab Autocomplete to `/splitself`\n\n## CHANGED:\n- Removed `CAMERA` event and merged it with the `SHRINK` event instead\n- Completely removed YACL as a dependency and added a custom configuration screen!\n  - Accessible through Mod Menu **OR** through `Options > Split Self Configuration`\n- Changed The Other\n  - There's a new variant of The Other that can spawn after entering sleep stage 2\n  - This variant can attack you and deals a LOT of damage, be careful!\n- Changed `NOTEPAD` event to support unicode\n- Changed `EMERGENCY` event for API usage instead\n- Changed some events to disable the pause button whilst the event is running\n- Changed signs placed by the mod to be automatically translated\n- Changed some of the sounds to be less ear piercing\n- Changed `BROWSER` event to support Brave\n \n## FIXED:\n- Fixed client desync when teleporting to the Limbo dimension\n- Fixed Firefox checks in `BROWSER` event, as well as proper handling for duplicate entries\n- Fixed The Other's initial goals being forgotten on game restart\n- Reduced file size from ~63MB to ~24MB (That's about 62% less file!)\n- Removed Herobrine"
		},
