			"notes": "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> There is **no** 'safe' version included with this release, although no damage is ever truly done anyway. 'Safe' versions will be accessible once the full release is out.\n\n## ADDED:\n- Added Pause Event\n- Added Item Event\n- Added Name Event\n- Added Frame Event\n- Added Image Frame Item\n- Added disappearing sound effects when you're too close to The Other in limbo\n- Added an alert for windows being only fully supported for now\n- Added Stage config, which disables events until you reach a certain \"Sleep Stage\". *This can be found with /SplitSelf debugSleepStage*\n- Added complete German translation of the mod (Thank you @ieguana)\n- Added One Time Events to config which, when ticked on, will only activate once per session\n\n## CHANGED:\n- Changed pacing of the events through 'Sleep Stages'\n- Changed The Other's proximity jumpscare, (to be enhanced more later)\n- Changed The Other to disable entity pushing\n- Changed player's gamemode to adventure whilst in Limbo\n- Changed Invert event to auto change your inverted mouse after a minute\n- Changed default config slightly (Event Chance: 0.003 -> 0.01, Event Tick Interval: 20 -> 60)\n- [Changed Event Cooldown Minimum Limit to 100 ticks](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7pL9SsgvIpo)\n \n ## FIXED:\n- Fixed InventoryOverlay event not playing sound like it should\n- Fixed PII being shown whilst being disabled on rare occasions\n- Fixed Shrink event not actually shrinking the screen\n- Fixed Escape and F11 keys not working once Shrink event activated\n- Fixed crash when Multiplayer/Realms button was missing due to other mods hiding it\n- Fixed a softlock when you relog in Limbo\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Pryzmm/Split-Self/commits/0.4.0-alpha"
